  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid PSO-inspired heuristic described as PSO+QAOA for portfolio optimization using 20 stocks and 50 trading days of data, reporting lower mean risk values (0.0209–0.0583 across expected return levels) than DE, GA, and classical PSO. Experiments were run in Matlab on a classical CPU, with portfolio returns reaching about 0.533% at the highest tested risk level (3.9×10⁻⁴). No quantum circuits, qubits, or hardware implementations are provided.",
